---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /projects/
title: Projects
description: "Things built and shipped: a bedtime picture book publishing pipeline, agent prototypes, a local voice assistant, generative facial landmarks, and browser graphics demos."
---

<section class="content-page">
    <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="section-heading__eyebrow">Projects</p>
        <h1 class="section-heading__title">Built and shipped</h1>
        <p class="section-heading__lede">
            The long writeups live in <a href="/writing/">Writing</a>; this page is the index.
            Anything that runs in a browser is linked directly below it.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        {%- for project in projects %}
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
            <div class="card h-100 text-left">
                <a class="personal-project-image-link" href="{{ project.url }}">
                    <img class="card-img-top personal-project-image" src="{{ project.imageUrl }}" alt="{{ project.name }}" loading="lazy">
                </a>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title"><a href="{{ project.url }}">{{ project.name }}</a></h5>
                    <p class="card-text">{{ project.description }}</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        {%- endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="about-panel">
        <p class="section-heading__eyebrow">Runs in the browser</p>
        <h2 class="proto-subheading">Open one and poke at it</h2>
        <ul class="writing-list">
            {%- for demo in demos %}
            <li class="writing-item">
                <h3 class="writing-item__title"><a href="{{ demo.url }}">{{ demo.name }}</a></h3>
                <p class="writing-item__brief">
                    {{ demo.note }}
                    {%- if demo.writeup %}
                    &middot; <a href="{{ demo.writeup }}">writeup</a>
                    {%- endif %}
                </p>
            </li>
            {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>
